  transform: translate(2px, 2px);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #000000;
}"},{"num":"02","name":"Minimalist Scandinavian","nameZh":"北欧极简纯白","category":"minimal","categoryZh":"现代极简与数字科技","family":"现代极简与数字科技","familyId":"01-现代极简与数字科技","subtitle":"极其开阔的留白、0.5px 发丝级微弱描边与中性灰阶，无压迫的平静克制","philosophy":"删繁就简，少即是多。通过严苛的排版字阶与温润的灰阶消解信息焦虑，让核心内容自在呼吸。","bestFor":"极简日记笔记、个人财务记账、日程待办、高端音响遥控器。","keywords":["ultra generous whitespace","hairline borders 0.5px","subtle neutral grays","tight tracking","muted typography","whisper drop-shadow","soft rounded-2xl"],"colors":[{"name":"Snow White","hex":"#FFFFFF"},{"name":"Soft Neutral","hex":"#F8F9FA"},{"name":"Charcoal Slate","hex":"#1E293B"},{"name":"Whisper Gray","hex":"#E2E8F0"},{"name":"Muted Blue","hex":"#3B82F6"}],"prompt":"Design a clean Scandinavian minimalist mobile UI. Palette: pure snow white (#FFFFFF), delicate off-white (#F8F9FA), muted charcoal (#1E293B) and subtle gray (#64748B). Use hairline 0.5px borders (rgba(0,0,0,0.06)), generous whitespace, tight typography hierarchy (Inter/SF Pro), smooth rounded-2xl cards with soft whisper shadows (0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.02)).","cssSnippet":".nordic-card {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
