}"},{"num":"03","name":"Linear / Raycast Dark","nameZh":"极客高精暗黑质感","category":"minimal","categoryZh":"现代极简与数字科技","family":"现代极简与数字科技","familyId":"01-现代极简与数字科技","subtitle":"黑曜石级暗色、微光边缘描边与高精度微对比，开发者的终极审美","philosophy":"追求像素级的精致与效率。通过微弱的径向高光和等宽元数据标签，构建沉稳而强大的专业生产力气场。","bestFor":"AI原生交互工具、开发者移动端终端、GitHub客户端、云原生运维看板。","keywords":["obsidian black #0B0D0E","hairline glow border","radial spotlight","monospace tag","keyboard-first","high micro-contrast"],"colors":[{"name":"Obsidian","hex":"#0B0D0E"},{"name":"Surface Dark","hex":"#16191E"},{"name":"Laser Violet","hex":"#8B5CF6"},{"name":"Border Glow","hex":"#2A2E39"},{"name":"High White","hex":"#F8FAFC"}],"prompt":"Create an ultra-sleek Linear / Raycast inspired dark mode mobile UI. Dark obsidian background (#0B0D0E, #121518), hairline border accents (1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)), subtle radial gradients for hover/active glow, purple-indigo pill indicators, refined monospace metadata tags, and razor-sharp typography.","cssSnippet":".linear-card {
