}"},{"num":"05","name":"Monochrome High-Fashion","nameZh":"黑白高奢先锋","category":"minimal","categoryZh":"现代极简与数字科技","family":"现代极简与数字科技","familyId":"01-现代极简与数字科技","subtitle":"极致纯黑白、Bodoni/Playfair 经典衬线标题与金属香槟金微点缀，高定气场","philosophy":"奢华不需要喧闹的色彩。通过黑与白的极致对抗以及衬线体的优雅弧度，呈现永恒的高级定制质感。","bestFor":"奢侈品电商 Lookbook、高定时装展买手店、高端香水与名表甄选。","keywords":["pure monochrome grayscale","editorial serif headings","Playfair/Bodoni","razor-sharp borders","champagne gold #D4AF37"],"colors":[{"name":"Velvet Black","hex":"#111111"},{"name":"Silk Ecru","hex":"#FAF9F6"},{"name":"Champagne Gold","hex":"#D4AF37"},{"name":"Pure White","hex":"#FFFFFF"}],"prompt":"Design a high-fashion luxury editorial mobile UI in pure monochrome. High-contrast pure black and off-white silk canvas (#FAF9F6). Elegant high-contrast serif typography for headings (Playfair / Bodoni), minimal razor-thin borders, generous spatial rhythm, and subtle champagne gold (#D4AF37) accents for micro-badges.","cssSnippet":".luxury-title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}"},{"num":"06","name":"Liquid Glassmorphism","nameZh":"液态拟玻 (iOS 18 Ambient Glass)","category":"depth","categoryZh":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","family":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","familyId":"02-玻璃拟物与空间深度","subtitle":"多重高斯模糊、半透明液态折射与虹彩高光边缘，通透如水","philosophy":"让界面融于环境。界面不再是一堵死板的墙，而是一片能透射背景流光的灵动水晶，触动空间感知。","bestFor":"高品质音乐流媒体播放器、智慧家庭环境控制、新一代系统控制中心。","keywords":["backdrop-filter: blur(24px)","translucent frosted glass","specular edge 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3)","iridescent ambient glow"],"colors":[{"name":"Glass Base","hex":"rgba(255,255,255,0.18)"},{"name":"Ambient Cyan","hex":"#06B6D4"},{"name":"Ambient Violet","hex":"#8B5CF6"},{"name":"Deep Background","hex":"#0F172A"}],"prompt":"Create a modern Liquid Glassmorphism mobile UI inspired by Apple VisionOS and iOS 18 ambient glass. Multi-layer backdrop blur (backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%)), semi-transparent frosted white surfaces (rgba(255,255,255,0.15)), specular 1px white border highlights, subtle inner shadows, and dynamic colorful ambient background orbs.","cssSnippet":".liquid-glass {
