  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  border-radius: 24px;
}"},{"num":"07","name":"Soft Neumorphism 2.0","nameZh":"微柔新拟态 (Soft UI)","category":"depth","categoryZh":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","family":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","familyId":"02-玻璃拟物与空间深度","subtitle":"摒弃脏阴影的进化版双向柔光映射，如同挤压高档温润黏土","philosophy":"重构实体触觉。利用两束反向自然光晕营造仿佛从背景中自然凸起或凹陷的触觉幻象，温润且柔和。","bestFor":"智能恒温器调节界面、冥想助眠白噪音、高端新能源车机遥控器。","keywords":["dual soft shadows","warm clay undertone","tactile depression","soft pill toggle","debossed surface"],"colors":[{"name":"Clay Canvas","hex":"#E8ECEF"},{"name":"Light Specular","hex":"#FFFFFF"},{"name":"Soft Shadow","hex":"#CBD5E1"},{"name":"Teal Accent","hex":"#14B8A6"}],"prompt":"Design a refined Soft Neumorphism 2.0 mobile interface. Neutral warm-gray background (#E8ECEF). Cards and buttons seamlessly extruded from background using dual-direction soft lighting: box-shadow: -6px -6px 14px #FFFFFF, 6px 6px 14px #CBD5E1. Tactile debossed active states, pill-shaped toggles, clean pastel turquoise accent (#14B8A6).","cssSnippet":".neu-surface {
