  box-shadow: 7px 7px 16px #CBD5E1, -7px -7px 16px #FFFFFF;
}"},{"num":"08","name":"Spatial / VisionOS UI","nameZh":"空间计算悬浮分层","category":"depth","categoryZh":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","family":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","familyId":"02-玻璃拟物与空间深度","subtitle":"多层纵深 Z 轴悬浮、大弧度超椭圆 (Squircle 28px) 与视线注视流光","philosophy":"为三维世界而生的二维界面。每一个面板都是悬浮在现实世界中的空间切片，拥有独立的光线交互与体积感。","bestFor":"Apple Vision Pro 伴侣 App、空间全景相册、沉浸式 3D 影音播客。","keywords":["volumetric floating glass","z-depth parallax layers","squircle curves rounded-[28px]","ambient depth illumination","gaze hover glow"],"colors":[{"name":"Smoked Glass","hex":"rgba(30,30,35,0.75)"},{"name":"Gaze Cyan","hex":"#38BDF8"},{"name":"Space Black","hex":"#0A0A0C"}],"prompt":"Design a VisionOS inspired spatial computing mobile UI. Semi-translucent dark smoked glass panels, deep z-axis spatial elevation, large squircle corners (rounded-[28px]), ambient rim lighting that simulates gaze focus, floating layered widgets, and ultra-crisp white iconography.","cssSnippet":".spatial-card {
