}"},{"num":"09","name":"Modern Skeuomorphism Craft","nameZh":"现代精密拟物工坊","category":"depth","categoryZh":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","family":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","familyId":"02-玻璃拟物与空间深度","subtitle":"拉丝航空铝材、滚花旋钮微纹理与物理弹簧机械阻尼，重塑物理尊严","philosophy":"反击无脑扁平化。重现高保真硬件设备的精工拉丝金属、碳纤维质感与微动开关，提供令人上瘾的真实握持感。","bestFor":"专业音频均衡器、专业胶片相机调参、黑胶唱机模拟器、名贵机械表指南针。","keywords":["brushed aluminum","knurled dial","subtle stitch","warm incandescent LED","mechanical depth"],"colors":[{"name":"Brushed Titanium","hex":"#232830"},{"name":"Knurled Steel","hex":"#4A5568"},{"name":"Amber LED","hex":"#F59E0B"}],"prompt":"Create a modern skeuomorphic craft mobile UI inspired by Teenage Engineering and Leica cameras. Finely textured brushed dark titanium (#1F2428), knurled metallic rotary controls, amber LED status indicator lights (#F59E0B), realistic bevel borders, and mechanical spring switch toggles.","cssSnippet":".craft-panel {
