}"},{"num":"10","name":"Claymorphism 3D","nameZh":"3D膨胀黏土风","category":"depth","categoryZh":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","family":"玻璃拟物与空间深度","familyId":"02-玻璃拟物与空间深度","subtitle":"充气质感圆润泡泡形态、彩色弥散软阴影与糖果粉彩，童趣治愈","philosophy":"给严肃的屏幕注入亲和力。圆滚滚的胖乎乎卡片与高弹性微动效，如同柔软的彩色黏土，让人忍不住想按压。","bestFor":"儿童益智启蒙、亲子宠物养成游戏、趣味记账、年轻化社交打赏。","keywords":["inflated 3D pillowy shapes","candy pastel clay","bouncy squishy buttons","rounded-3xl"],"colors":[{"name":"Lavender Clay","hex":"#C084FC"},{"name":"Bubblegum Pink","hex":"#F472B6"},{"name":"Mint Sherbet","hex":"#34D399"}],"prompt":"Design a playful Claymorphism 3D mobile app UI. Chunky, inflated marshmallow-like 3D cards with smooth rounded-3xl corners. Use pastel candy palette (bubblegum pink #F472B6, soft lavender #C084FC, mint green #34D399). Multi-layer colored drop shadows for deep pillowy volume.","cssSnippet":".clay-card {
