}"},{"num":"12","name":"Bioluminescent Dark","nameZh":"深海荧光科技","category":"cyber","categoryZh":"赛博、科幻与未来主义","family":"赛博、科幻与未来主义","familyId":"03-赛博科幻与未来主义","subtitle":"万米海沟深邃午夜蓝、磷光水母薄荷绿与紫晶荧光微光脉冲，神秘空灵","philosophy":"自然生物电与高科技的隐秘融合。犹如在深海海底见证微光浮游生物的自发光律动，静谧、优雅且不可思议。","bestFor":"AI深度思考过程可视化、智能睡眠与梦境追踪、观星与太空天文探索。","keywords":["abyssal navy #030712","phosphorescent teal #00F5D4","breathing pulse","ethereal dark"],"colors":[{"name":"Bio Teal","hex":"#00F5D4"},{"name":"Abyssal Navy","hex":"#030712"},{"name":"Bio Violet","hex":"#9D4EDD"}],"prompt":"Design an ethereal Bioluminescent Dark mobile interface. Abyssal midnight navy background (#030712, #071322), glowing phosphorescent accents in marine teal (#00F5D4) and deep bio-violet (#7928CA). Soft radial gradient halos that mimic deep-sea organism breathing pulses, subtle wave telemetry lines, and floating luminescent cards.","cssSnippet":".bio-card {
